OL,3,APolice helped remove Russell Brand
OL,4,Aafter 'violent incident' at Jemima
OL,5,AGoldsmith's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoldsmith, who dated Brand for about a
OL,8,Fyear, wrote on X on Monday that she
OL,9,F"had to call the police to have him
OL,10,Fremoved from my house in 2014 during a
OL,11,Fviolent incident" but chose not to
OL,12,Fpress charges.
